[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mtranslation/tests/common/mod.rs[0m — [38;5;10mdlopen[0ms both [38;5;10mc_src/build/libdriver.so[0m and [38;5;10mtranslation/target/<profile>/libdriver.so[0m via [38;5;10mlibloading[0m and resolves [38;5;10mdecode_base64[0m by symbol name in each. The Rust side is never called directly, so the [38;5;10m#[unsafe(no_mangle)][0m wrapper is under test.[0m[0m
